"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"2d3_fsd_1dh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"ig9_uk1_7rh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p099","text":"八年，使郤克於齊。齊頃公母從樓上觀而笑之。所以然者，郤克僂，而魯使蹇，衞使眇，故齊亦令人如之以導客。郤克怒，歸至河上，曰：「不報齊者，河伯視之！」至國，請君，欲伐齊。景公問知其故，曰：「子之怨，安足以煩國！」弗聽。魏文子請老休，辟郤克，克執政。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"齊頃公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"魯使","kind":"person","person_id":"l44_3nw_9xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"衞使","kind":"person","person_id":"dfz_u6h_g3y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"導客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"4lj_xrf_bsl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"魏文子","kind":"person","person_id":"k4r_wry_qcs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m099-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p101","text":"十一年春，齊伐魯，取隆。魯告急衞，衞與魯皆因郤克告急於晉。晉乃使郤克、欒書、韓厥以兵車八百乘與魯、衞共伐齊。夏，與頃公戰於砹傷困頃公。頃公乃與其右易位，下取飲，以得脱去。齊師敗走，晉追北至齊。頃公獻寶器以求平，不聽。郤克曰：「必得蕭桐姪子爲質。」齊使曰：「蕭桐姪子，頃公母；頃公母猶晉君母，柰何必得之？不義，請復戰。」晉乃許與平而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"xx7_loh_2ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"y3i_rsz_brn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"頃公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"頃公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"頃公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m101-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"其右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等